BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 678 Tm (1. Read the pool's virtual-device configuration from device labels. The physical disks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 661.5 Tm (mirror or RAIDZ arrangement must be known before translating any logical block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 635 Tm (2. Inspect the uberblock rings and select a valid committed transaction-group state; an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 618.5 Tm (older valid root may remain available after an interrupted update.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 592 Tm (3. Follow the committed uberblock to the Meta Object Set, then to datasets, object sets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 575.5 Tm (and their dnodes rather than expecting a traditional fixed inode table.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 549 Tm (4. Decode each block pointer's logical and physical sizes, birth transaction, checksum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 532.5 Tm (and compression information to locate and validate the child block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 506 Tm (5. Use metaslab allocation maps and spacemaps to interpret free space. A file's pathname) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 489.5 Tm (is not enough to determine whether a particular physical sector is in use.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 463 Tm (6. Recognise that multiple datasets and snapshots can retain earlier block versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 446.5 Tm (Reclaiming a block requires resolving all live references.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 420 Tm (7. Distinguish data vdevs from log, cache, spare and special allocation classes; not all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 403.5 Tm (devices in a pool store the same kind of persistent user data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 377 Tm (8. Interpret ZAP objects, indirect blocks and bonus buffers in the context of each object) Tj ET
